    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Psychological horror in format of a visual novel, created using a neural network.</h2><br><br>The game is a text horror quest in which player is shown a story, by displaying text on the screen, accompanied by images, musical and sound environments.<br><br>The player can influence course of the game's history by answering simple questions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet the main characters of the story:</h2><br><br><strong>King</strong> - A brave and courageous hero who declared war on the Big Eye.<br><strong>A guy named Bumble</strong> - One of the king's friends, an explorer of other worlds.<br><strong>Mack</strong> - Lover of astral adventures. Almost died as a result of a psychological experiment with coins.<br><br>As they adventure, they encounter life, death, and borderline states.",
